PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: MB11

   1 a 0000     program mulprobe-MB11;   [E2E-15 MB11: DR small-constant FIXED multiply, literal LEFT 2 times compound]
   2 a 0000         fixed n, m;
   3 a 0000         procedure f returns fixed;   fixed j;
   4 a 0000             begin f = j + 1; end;
   5 a 0000         begin
   6 a 0000             n = 7;
   7 a 0000             m = 2 * (n + 1);
   8 a 0000         end.

